# Rules that apply to the whole repo. Anything true of only one of the three
# folders belongs in that folder's own .gitignore, where its paths stay
# relative to the thing they describe — see HexPlore-webserver/.gitignore for
# the database and the map data, and the two app folders for Xcode's leavings.

# Local Claude Code settings (personal permissions); .claude/ itself is shared
.claude/settings.local.json

# The nightly worktree lives here. It is a second checkout of this same repo,
# so committing it would commit the repo into itself.
.claude/worktrees/

# iCloud conflict copies ("main 2.js") — this project sits under a synced
# ~/Documents, and a conflicted duplicate of a source file is never wanted.
* [0-9].*

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
